      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"one day at a time\" feels like a joke when every day is exactly the same. just the same smells, the same sounds of the machines, the same feeling of being stuck in a loop. it’s not even sadness anymore, it’s just... nothingness. it feels like i already stopped existing a long time ago. i'm just a body moving through the rooms. does that even make sense? it feels like the only way to actually find some peace is for everything to just... stop. all of it.",
